  "sentences": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "text": "A galaxy's oxygen abundance is how much oxygen its gas holds.",
      "text_sha256": "0dbc33a7618027fbded6e7c1d2e12ad7d928b80060cac206461d644c0d46d325",
      "words": 11,
      "raw": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_01_michael_speed1_0dbc33a76180_24k.wav",
      "raw_sha256": "4c2fe26b8ed7f5870005da02b3278cc9fc29417b38664dc8e27500fa87de10a9",
      "raw_format": {
        "codec": "PCM signed 24-bit little-endian",
        "sample_rate": 24000,
        "channels": 1
      },
      "processed": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_01_michael_speed1_0dbc33a76180_48k.wav",
      "processed_sha256": "054c5040bbcd527262d1cce256e73ffb4c1239f7d734d23b9658d98701068e1d",
      "processed_duration_seconds": 4.757333,
      "anchors": [
        "sources-v4/z9-metallicity.md:23-26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "text": "Stars forge that oxygen, so it grows as galaxies build stars.",
      "text_sha256": "2269fad2f2a410f61de84d6577fb6ef1438431d733151b0a5d3c06b985b0e68c",
      "words": 11,
      "raw": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_02_michael_speed1_2269fad2f2a4_24k.wav",
      "raw_sha256": "f23c93d423b4e7495373e7730786ecc2747dc68b3c3d62e4f70e7dd6042c254e",
      "raw_format": {
        "codec": "PCM signed 24-bit little-endian",
        "sample_rate": 24000,
        "channels": 1
      },
      "processed": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_02_michael_speed1_2269fad2f2a4_48k.wav",
      "processed_sha256": "45d0eaae8852792777da74aa82c5a00f20dad559d7e25b7cb6fd8c98ff492a46",
      "processed_duration_seconds": 4.608,
      "anchors": [
        "sources-v4/z9-metallicity.md:23-26",
        "sources-v4/z9-metallicity.md:63"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "text": "This paper asks whether galaxies at redshift nine to ten had already reached nearby levels.",
      "text_sha256": "5dcfc3127135f1f95bf3c282c7c0dc70a86fddb2b0557576c2bfba8730253e9b",
      "words": 15,
      "raw": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_03_michael_speed1_5dcfc3127135_24k.wav",
      "raw_sha256": "b6b91519188f64f563641417b284ae28b65abba21e9d1db3d5dfd56573be7e94",
      "raw_format": {
        "codec": "PCM signed 24-bit little-endian",
        "sample_rate": 24000,
        "channels": 1
      },
      "processed": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_03_michael_speed1_5dcfc3127135_48k.wav",
      "processed_sha256": "52c78b5d968732b9a10e6a3fddf235196e1d0c3be7fe9fd7874339759c263ac4",
      "processed_duration_seconds": 6.016,
      "anchors": [
        "sources-v4/z9-metallicity.md:26-33"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "text": "Answering is tricky, because gravitational lensing can distort galaxy masses, and the nearby benchmark is extrapolated.",
      "text_sha256": "4cbc6d7d23b776b64139284cafdae6114b20728a8873eda37b80cf0b78e4b4be",
      "words": 16,
      "raw": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_04_michael_speed1_4cbc6d7d23b7_24k.wav",
      "raw_sha256": "48d449071011c66f287243fd87f168fa7d504440b1ff037a23b2ea7b96e5b0ee",
      "raw_format": {
        "codec": "PCM signed 24-bit little-endian",
        "sample_rate": 24000,
        "channels": 1
      },
      "processed": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_04_michael_speed1_4cbc6d7d23b7_48k.wav",
      "processed_sha256": "c043e03f08fb5e745ebd1048f6ad429f0e28e2c5d61a8bf5e0780c4c150e9980",
      "processed_duration_seconds": 8.618667,
      "anchors": [
        "sources-v4/z9-metallicity.md:26-31",
        "sources-v4/z9-metallicity.md:73-74",
        "sources-v4/z9-metallicity.md:94-96"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "text": "So the paper uses five strictly unlensed galaxies, measured by the direct electron-temperature method.",
      "text_sha256": "a3dc513fe8728a55198ed48c239aa2f4543a2d6b3a19414ec76d4275e4867a46",
      "words": 14,
      "raw": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_05_michael_speed1_a3dc513fe872_24k.wav",
      "raw_sha256": "2d3c48d68faeeb6dd4cb750e983b4457151e88e691140e0183d2cf7802c62853",
      "raw_format": {
        "codec": "PCM signed 24-bit little-endian",
        "sample_rate": 24000,
        "channels": 1
      },
      "processed": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_05_michael_speed1_a3dc513fe872_48k.wav",
      "processed_sha256": "1f91d4a6629a0fc3f50dd8c50cf08882f40d21180f0f2f1d2b8fa7055473137a",
      "processed_duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "anchors": [
        "sources-v4/z9-metallicity.md:33"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "text": "The result: their oxygen sits near one fifth of the nearby benchmark.",
      "text_sha256": "37407643a84e3a9ced6b765a4d2497ba0a8071a7cb0b60018e468f07ea3a6431",
      "words": 12,
      "raw": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_06_michael_speed1_37407643a84e_24k.wav",
      "raw_sha256": "98a24b85587849d5a79781519f9f7847e0f75276f7bd086ccc65e5ab6ff3727f",
      "raw_format": {
        "codec": "PCM signed 24-bit little-endian",
        "sample_rate": 24000,
        "channels": 1
      },
      "processed": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_06_michael_speed1_37407643a84e_48k.wav",
      "processed_sha256": "f343a5597d547a0e3807c8a636e965c42712e6bb3bd03f0b49f24eb08c1a063f",
      "processed_duration_seconds": 4.565333,
      "anchors": [
        "sources-v4/z9-metallicity.md:34",
        "sources-v4/z9-metallicity.md:96"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "text": "In logarithmic units, that is zero point six nine dex lower.",
      "text_sha256": "1013cd4580ac8d0367f3713148c3fd780cdded5f5f547d3e1c4aa4c5d169e223",
      "words": 11,
      "raw": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_07_michael_speed1_1013cd4580ac_24k.wav",
      "raw_sha256": "f73bc1589f6beb0e3398c9820efb8d1d898e0960317a9971a0ba1c257f9c83f7",
      "raw_format": {
        "codec": "PCM signed 24-bit little-endian",
        "sample_rate": 24000,
        "channels": 1
      },
      "processed": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_07_michael_speed1_1013cd4580ac_48k.wav",
      "processed_sha256": "918b6e8617b1b42ba940beeba8b89a17e1e1266089b681db3296056283139dbf",
      "processed_duration_seconds": 4.373333,
      "anchors": [
        "sources-v4/z9-metallicity.md:34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "text": "The sample is small, and the absolute abundance scale stays uncertain.",
      "text_sha256": "74cc76dd05067730a6c6f3a31d0fef572323ac0543cdc1f91b84dcedd8671d9f",
      "words": 11,
      "raw": "/Users/duhokim/NebulaMind/NebulaMind/.hermes/handoffs/paper-videos-v5-graphics-first-20260723T142500Z/v5_g1_audio/sentence_08_michael_speed1_74cc76dd0506_24k.wav",
      "raw_sha256": "3eff66778c4147a92869e8fea8f858abbaa9fc3915a0e80daebfed52ba8e5eb9",
      "raw_format": {
        "codec": "PCM signed 24-bit little-endian",
